    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This small plastic device acts as a wallet for your credits, storing an essentially unlimited amount, and can be plugged into machine ports and connected to other crypto sticks. Crypto sticks come branded from a variety of banks, and they allow for untraceable transactions between individuals. A small screen indicates how many cryptopoints are stored on a crypto stick, and it may be secured with a thumbprint scanner or a passcode.</p>",
